  "evidence": [
    "Five actual PostgreSQL use-case tests and97 native API/OpenAPI cases pass, including all16 group configuration cases, both default-disabled cases,9 legacy Matrix configuration cases and70 contract cases. Full worker128 passes with one existing retention skip.",
    "Opposite fictional participants in different companies concurrently open one immutable group pair through actual HTTP, preserve the same receipt on replay, keep version0 and never select a peer Matrix identity.",
    "Operation/pair/ordered-account/native guards, current caller/peer checks and atomic pair/receipt/audit/outbox publication are exercised. Journal failure, cancellation/interruption, peer revocation and native expiry during final member acquisition roll back all writes.",
    "Owned list/detail reads recheck native authority on both acquisition outcomes. An eligible owner can retain intent whose peer becomes unavailable; new opens and old receipt replays require current peer eligibility.",
    "Original company and conversation IDs remain separate coordinates through native metadata inventory. Both cursor fields are required together; terminal pages have no cursor, foreign ownership is hidden and no group conversation is implicitly created by inventory.",
    "Actual API denies missing native transport, missing idempotency header, old/web client, invalid cursor/page input, reused payload, revoked peer and unrelated reader. OpenAPI marks all new routes native/root-group, without company authority. Shared DI is validated in both actual application contexts."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No schema change beyond acceptedV129. Storage migration/archive/RLS evidence remains in collaboration-space-conversation-storage-2026-11-04.json; unchanged migration tests were not rerun for native-only integration.",
    "Intent and original-room metadata grant no provider room/key/content access. Explicit group room adoption/provisioning and canonical participant verification precede recipient query/claim/to-device/content/sync/push.",
    "Full Mobile preflight/stage/freeze/completion/adoption, original SDK/history/uncertain-send retention and native hard-parent recovery remain required. Offline receiving must not depend on short native/provider credentials.",
    "No Mobile caller, product APK, phone interaction or rollout. Group disabled and all54 communications groups open. Main d4df8767/Mobilebbba53ea/hosted product0b804cb2, normal phone28/live8b40/schema116 pushON/SMTPOFF and Starter9959c1d unchanged."
